SUSPECTED BUG: Save returns errors.Join(werr, flush(f), f.Close()). In
the default build flush always returns nil, but Join drops nil operands and still returns
the others. Expected: os.Create origins under "source: create: %w" AND, under an
errors.Join wrap, the (*os.File).Write and (*os.File).Close origins (os.ErrInvalid,
os.ErrClosed, errno values ...). Actual: only the os.Create entry; the whole Join
disappears as soon as one operand is a call that can only return nil (compare
save_join_durable, where flush can fail and the Write/Close origins are listed).
